# Student Management CRUD App

A full-stack Student Management application built with **React** (frontend), **Node.js** (backend), and **Neon Database** (PostgreSQL). This project is designed for learning purposes and demonstrates authentication and basic CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations.

---

## 🚀 Features

* 🔐 User Authentication (Signup/Login)
* 👨‍💼 Admin-only access
* ➕ Add new students
* 📋 View all students
* ✏️ Edit student details
* ❌ Delete students
* 🌐 Full-stack integration (React + Node.js + PostgreSQL)

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend

* React
* Axios (for API requests)
* React Router (for navigation)

### Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* PostgreSQL (Neon Database)
* JWT (Authentication)
* bcrypt (Password hashing)

---

